   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "Airtime utilisation (%)",
   "description": "Estimated share of airtime each AP is busy (AP agent channel_util). Dashed line: 80%, the congestion limit in the time-to-recover KPI (docs/problem_statement.md).",
   "datasource": {
